{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01R9UM8wi8Us8GNpw1hjZcAT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The build is still failing because of the invalid pseudo-elements. The CSS parser is correctly identifying that `::scroll-button()`, `::scroll-marker`, and `::scroll-marker-item` are not valid CSS pseudo-elements.\n\nThe issue is that I'm trying to use pseudo-elements that don't exist. The @supports check should prevent these from being parsed, but Turbopack is still validating them.\n\nI need to wrap the entire carousel CSS section in a way that Turbopack won't try to parse the invalid pseudo-elements. One way is to use a comment-based approach or to use a different strategy.\n\nActually, looking at the error more carefully, it seems like Turbopack is parsing the CSS inside the @supports block even though the condition is false. This is a known issue with some CSS parsers.\n\nLet me try a different approach: I'll move the carousel CSS to a separate comment block or use a different syntax that won't confuse the parser. Or I could just remove the fictional pseudo-element styles and keep only the fallback CSS.\n\nGiven that the pseudo-elements don't exist anyway, and the fallback CSS is what will actually be used, let me simplify this to just have the working fallback CSS without the invalid pseudo-element declarations.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":109596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":738},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8cb50fe-9df1-48cd-b7a1-251e7a41c10c","uuid":"52a3992a-79ab-4113-8edb-0ffda35f69e6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01R9UM8wi8Us8GNpw1hjZcAT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The issue is that Turbopack is trying to parse the invalid pseudo-elements even inside @supports. Let me simplify the CSS to avoid this - we only need the fallback CSS since the pseudo-elements don't exist:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":109596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":738},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8cb50fe-9df1-48cd-b7a1-251e7a41c10c","uuid":"b56a7b69-e30c-4f06-8905-a07f2f118692"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01R9UM8wi8Us8GNpw1hjZcAT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VrFLvMDz8H35hLAwSJkB1n","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css","old_string":"/* ============================================================\n   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)\n   Chrome 135+ proposed ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker\n   pseudo-elements for automatic ARIA button roles and\n   keyboard handling. Wrapped in @supports guard for future.\n   Current fallback: scroll-snap CSS with hidden scrollbar.\n   Ensures CLS=0 via fixed aspect-ratio on carousel items.\n   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/carousels-with-css\n   Spec: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-marker-group\n   ============================================================ */\n\n/* Future Chrome 135+ native scroll-driven carousel support */\n@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll prev/next buttons with built-in ARIA roles */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev) {\n    width: 2.75rem;\n    height: 2.75rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    background-color: white;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition-property: background-color, box-shadow;\n    transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    transition-duration: 150ms;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev):hover {\n    background-color: #f5f5f4;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {\n    width: 2.75rem;\n    height: 2.75rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    background-color: white;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition-property: background-color, box-shadow;\n    transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    transition-duration: 150ms;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next):hover {\n    background-color: #f5f5f4;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll marker group for keyboard-accessible navigation dots */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {\n    width: 0.5rem;\n    height: 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    background-color: #d6d3d1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition-property: background-color;\n    transition-duration: 150ms;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {\n    background-color: #b45309;\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev),\n    .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {\n      background-color: #292524;\n    }\n\n    .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev):hover,\n    .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next):hover {\n      background-color: #44403c;\n    }\n\n    .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {\n      background-color: #78716c;\n    }\n\n    .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {\n      background-color: #fbbf24;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback: browsers without ::scroll-button() support degrade gracefully */\n@supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n}","new_string":"/* ============================================================\n   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)\n   Implements scroll-snap carousel with graceful degradation.\n   Future: Chrome 135+ may support ::scroll-button() and\n   ::scroll-marker pseudo-elements for automatic controls.\n   Currently uses scroll-snap CSS for fallback browsers.\n   Ensures CLS=0 via fixed aspect-ratio on carousel items.\n   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/carousels-with-css\n   Spec: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-marker-group\n   ============================================================ */\n\n/* Scroll-snap carousel with hidden scrollbar (all browsers) */\n.carousel-scroll-container {\n  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n  -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\n.carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.carousel-scroll-container > * {\n  scroll-snap-align: start;\n  scroll-snap-stop: always;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":109596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":738},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo